>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYCLOSE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-LINE PIC X(512).
01 RECON-STATUS PIC X(16).
01 DELIVERY-ACK PIC X.
01 REPORT-COMPLETE PIC X.
01 ARCHIVE-COMPLETE PIC X.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
    UNSTRING INPUT-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO RECON-STATUS DELIVERY-ACK REPORT-COMPLETE ARCHIVE-COMPLETE
    END-UNSTRING
    IF RECON-STATUS = "BALANCED" AND DELIVERY-ACK = "1"
        DISPLAY "COMPLETE"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "WAIT_CLOSE"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
